{"id":1207,"date":"2026-08-21T12:37:20","date_gmt":"2026-08-21T12:37:20","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1207"},"modified":"2026-08-21T15:50:44","modified_gmt":"2026-08-21T15:50:44","slug":"symbols","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/symbols\/symbols\/","title":{"rendered":"Symbols"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Symbols<\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">For special characters that would otherwise require memorising Unicode codes or copying from an external site, Open Publisher provides a rich <strong>Insert Symbol<\/strong> modal with hundreds of characters, live search, and a recently used tracker.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Inserting a Symbol<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1210\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-21-133605.png\" alt=\"Inserting a Symbol\" width=\"344\" height=\"323\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-21-133605.png 1016w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-21-133605-300x282.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-21-133605-768x722.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 344px) 100vw, 344px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To insert a symbol:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click inside any text box to position your cursor at the point where you want the symbol to appear.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>Insert &gt; Symbol<\/strong> (\u03a9 icon in the toolbar).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The Symbol modal opens, grouping hundreds of characters into easy-to-navigate categories (see below).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Use the <strong>Search bar<\/strong> to find a symbol by name (for example: \u201ccheck\u201d, \u201ceuro\u201d, or \u201carrow\u201d).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click any symbol to insert it instantly at your cursor position.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"western\">Symbols are inserted using native <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">execCommand(&#8216;insertText&#8217;)<\/span>, integrating flawlessly into both standard text boxes and advanced Flexbox text blocks.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Symbol Categories<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1246\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-21-162146.webp\" alt=\"Symbol Categories\" width=\"106\" height=\"115\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-21-162146.webp 416w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-21-162146-277x300.webp 277w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 106px) 100vw, 106px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The modal organises hundreds of characters into the following categories:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Common &#8211;<\/strong> Copyright \u00a9, trademark &#x2122;, registered \u00ae, and frequently used punctuation.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Dashes &amp; Quotes &#8211;<\/strong> Em dash, en dash, curly quotes, and ellipsis.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Currency &#8211;<\/strong> \u00a3, \u20ac, \u00a5, \u00a2, and more.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Math &amp; Science &#8211;<\/strong> \u00f7, \u00d7, \u221a, \u03c0, \u221e, and Greek letters.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Arrows &#8211;<\/strong> Directional arrows in multiple styles.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Shapes &amp; Stars &#8211;<\/strong> Geometric shapes and decorative stars.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Accented Letters &#8211;<\/strong> Accented Latin characters for international text.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Recently Used Symbols<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1247\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RecentlyUsedSymbols.webp\" alt=\"Recently Used Symbols\" width=\"105\" height=\"96\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RecentlyUsedSymbols.webp 445w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RecentlyUsedSymbols-300x273.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 105px) 100vw, 105px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The modal automatically tracks your 20 most recently used symbols in browser LocalStorage. They appear in a <strong>Recently Used<\/strong> row at the top of the modal every time you open it &#8211; your most frequent symbols are always one click away.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Live Preview<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1241\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-21-161814.png\" alt=\"Live Preview\" width=\"378\" height=\"143\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-21-161814.png 610w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-21-161814-300x114.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 378px) 100vw, 378px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Hovering over or clicking any symbol shows its name, character, and Unicode value in a live preview panel at the bottom of the modal, so you can confirm exactly what you are inserting before it goes into your document.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Symbols For special characters that would otherwise require memorising Unicode codes or copying from an external site, Open Publisher provides a rich Insert Symbol modal with hundreds of characters, live search, and a recently used tracker. Inserting a Symbol To insert a symbol: Click inside any text box to position your cursor at the point [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1251,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[18],"class_list":["post-1207","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-symbols"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1207","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1207"}],"version-history":[{"count":8,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1207\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1250,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1207\/revisions\/1250"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1251"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1207"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1207"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}